WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.713
I don't care about orientation or quizzes.

00:00:02.829 --> 00:00:03.629
You're not going out.

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:04.465
That's it.

00:00:04.535 --> 00:00:05.998
I'll stay here and make sure you don't.

00:00:05.998 --> 00:00:09.702
We can order food, watch something, but you're not
walking out that door tonight.